Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: PlotJuggler <noreply@plotjuggler.io>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://plotjuggler.io
Description: Visualize timeseries like a pro
 PlotJuggler is a fast, feature-rich application to visualize and analyze
 timeseries data — robotics logs, telemetry, CSV, MCAP, ROS bags, Parquet and
 more — with plots, 2D image/scene views and a 3D robotics viewer.
 .
 This package bundles its own Qt 6 runtime and third-party dependencies under
 /opt/plotjuggler4, so it does not use (or interfere with) the Qt packages
 installed on the system.
